Description: Convenient Utility to get and update CouchDB data
 Couchy is a Rust CLI and GUI tool for managing CouchDB data.
 It browses servers, databases, documents and users in a desktop
 GUI, backs up design documents, cleans up orphaned records and
 migrates MySQL data into CouchDB.
 .
 This package contains the couchy command line tool and GUI.
